      ],
      "text": "The server exposes a JSON-RPC 2.0 API over stdio, documented to include a cancel_task method for stopping the current or a named task and a clear_conversation method for resetting conversation history."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f4d6ef52c761d440c13bde67502350cfdd03d2ff01b6822d842bc1d65e6c1692",
