        "slc_736f76f0b0d65bf93a9477806010544cb66653490d8d9ffde3a1a0cca65a3f4a"
      ],
      "text": "The API docs state the server has no built-in authentication and should be treated as a trusted component, recommending a sandboxed deployment and passing model API keys through environment variables."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
