        "slc_fe7d326e292ca8644054ad30ace36102f279f304582665ccccd571164bf9a49e"
      ],
      "text": "A documented benchmark methodology measures how efficiently each tool performs against local Ollama models using simple test cases, with the results table automatically refreshed by the CI/CD pipeline on new pull requests."
    },
